<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1721454235"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:54.253"><div begin="31.320" end="46.802"><p begin="31.320" end="34.826" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.320" end="31.658">古</span><span begin="31.658" end="32.591">巴比伦王</span><span begin="32.591" end="33.291">颁布了</span><span begin="33.291" end="34.482">汉摩拉比法</span><span begin="34.482" end="34.826">典</span></p><p begin="34.914" end="39.141" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.914" end="35.421">刻在</span><span begin="35.421" end="36.806">黑色的玄武岩</span> <span begin="36.806" end="37.300">距今已经</span><span begin="37.300" end="38.273">三千七百</span><span begin="38.273" end="38.707">多</span><span begin="38.707" end="39.141">年</span></p><p begin="39.124" end="42.651" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.124" end="40.164">你在橱窗</span><span begin="40.164" end="40.480">前</span> <span begin="40.574" end="42.022">凝视碑文的字</span><span begin="42.022" end="42.651">眼</span></p><p begin="42.750" end="46.802" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.750" end="42.965">我却</span><span begin="42.965" end="43.875">在旁静静</span><span begin="43.875" end="45.097">欣赏你那张</span><span begin="45.097" end="45.830">我深爱</span><span begin="45.830" end="46.265">的</span><span begin="46.265" end="46.802">脸</span></p></div><div begin="46.931" end="1:02.217"><p begin="46.931" end="50.672" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.931" end="47.216">祭</span><span begin="47.216" end="47.730">司</span> <span begin="47.730" end="48.180">神殿</span> <span begin="48.180" end="48.429">征</span><span begin="48.429" end="48.897">战</span> <span begin="48.897" end="49.381">弓箭</span> <span begin="49.381" end="50.316">是谁的从</span><span begin="50.316" end="50.672">前</span></p><p begin="50.784" end="54.344" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.784" end="51.033">喜欢</span><span begin="51.033" end="51.959">在人潮中</span><span begin="51.959" end="53.128">你只属于我</span><span begin="53.128" end="53.783">的那画</span><span begin="53.783" end="54.344">面</span></p><p begin="54.476" end="58.476" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.476" end="56.461">经过苏美女神身边</span> <span begin="56.461" end="58.179">我以女神之名许</span><span begin="58.179" end="58.476">愿</span></p><p begin="58.736" end="1:02.217" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.736" end="59.064">思</span><span begin="59.064" end="1:00.938">念像底格里斯河般</span><span begin="1:00.938" end="1:01.425">的</span><span begin="1:01.425" end="1:01.674">漫</span><span begin="1:01.674" end="1:02.217">延</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.520" end="1:17.102"><p begin="1:02.520" end="1:08.659" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.520" end="1:02.870">当</span><span begin="1:02.870" end="1:04.270">古文明</span><span begin="1:04.270" end="1:05.187">只剩</span><span begin="1:05.187" end="1:05.689">下难</span><span begin="1:05.689" end="1:07.091">解的语</span><span begin="1:07.091" end="1:08.659">言</span></p><p begin="1:08.891" end="1:17.102" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.891" end="1:09.527">传说</span><span begin="1:09.527" end="1:10.009">就</span><span begin="1:10.009" end="1:10.177">成</span><span begin="1:10.177" end="1:10.701">了</span><span begin="1:10.822" end="1:11.129">永</span><span begin="1:11.129" end="1:11.878">垂</span><span begin="1:11.878" end="1:12.095">不</span><span begin="1:12.095" end="1:12.812">朽</span><span begin="1:12.812" end="1:13.013">的</span><span begin="1:13.013" end="1:13.947">诗</span><span begin="1:13.947" end="1:17.102">篇</span></p></div><div begin="1:17.664" end="1:32.473"><p begin="1:17.664" end="1:24.717" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.664" end="1:18.946">我给你的爱</span><span begin="1:18.946" end="1:19.880">写在西元</span><span begin="1:19.880" end="1:20.348">前</span> <span begin="1:20.348" end="1:22.781">深埋在美索不达米亚平</span><span begin="1:22.781" end="1:24.717">原</span></p><p begin="1:25.255" end="1:32.473" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.255" end="1:25.596">几</span><